@@ -2,6 +2,16 @@
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Day parts (`2d4h`) in `parse`, and days as the largest unit in `format`
+  (`format(93600000)` is `"1d 2h"`).
+
+### Changed
+
+- `format` renders durations of a day or more with `d` instead of hours
+  (`format(90000000)` was `"25h"`, now `"1d 1h"`).
+
 ## [1.4.0] - 2026-06-02
 
 ### Added
