 ## API
 
-- `parse(text)`: milliseconds from a duration made of `h`, `m`, `s` and `ms`
+- `parse(text)`: milliseconds from a duration made of `d`, `h`, `m`, `s` and `ms`
   parts. Throws `TypeError` on empty input and `SyntaxError` on anything else
   it cannot read.
-- `format(ms)`: the largest units first, separated by spaces. `0` is `"0s"`.
+- `format(ms)`: the largest units first, separated by spaces, with days as the
+  largest unit (a day is exactly 24 hours). `0` is `"0s"`.
 
 ## Versioning
 
